 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186323909 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ec2a17b-686d-53a5-85bd-9f9a7c05b248" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\lambda +3)(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda +2)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321262} {:answer/id #uuid "4436935a-9c77-5825-93ad-4fe1440b7256" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\lambda -8)(\\lambda +7)(\\lambda -3)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321685} {:answer/id #uuid "74b1c2e5-6145-5cc4-bc94-aaebe4115544" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\lambda (\\lambda -6)(\\lambda +7)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322057} {:answer/id #uuid "9463a6bd-6039-5bb1-b51a-8f0a65ed10b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda +2)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322326} {:answer/id #uuid "de933d31-9237-5767-9e80-05ad65f12e20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -6)(\\lambda +1)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322886}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186322326} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0111eb3-d3cf-5281-ab8a-9aad7c4b0933" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323511}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "85bd5d94-8ec9-55aa-af68-90409443e4f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-37390" :question/problem "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 10 & 0 \\\\ -5 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,B-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nB-\\lambda I=\\begin{bmatrix}8-\\lambda  & 10 & 0 \\\\ -5 & -7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -9 & 3-\\lambda \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe characteristic equation is $det(B-\\lambda I)=0.$ \n\nExpanding the determinant across the $3$rd column, we obtain the following:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ \\begin{vmatrix}8-\\lambda  & 10 & 0 \\\\ -5 & -7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -9 & 3-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )\\begin{vmatrix}8-\\lambda  & 10 \\\\ -5 & -7-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )((8-\\lambda )(-7-\\lambda )-(-5)(10)) & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )({\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -6) & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda +2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186323910 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c92bdd9-561f-50f8-a0af-b026acb7e7d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-4{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -52=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321751} {:answer/id #uuid "679f1b6a-bb22-58ad-9008-20f76acaf14c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-10{\\lambda }^{2}+43\\lambda -90=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321955} {:answer/id #uuid "688684d9-f540-59a5-826c-2faac539f6c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}+7{\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda -48=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321961} {:answer/id #uuid "a6e445b9-3e7b-5df5-8de9-a07b0a91fd34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-4{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda +6=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322453} {:answer/id #uuid "c8f0d0d9-d2ec-529d-bfe9-31a08f8548aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-4{\\lambda }^{2}+49\\lambda -138=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322711}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186322453} :answer-field/id #uuid "b4874765-573f-531a-bb89-b09ddf9d2051" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-fie